Package: censcast
Title: Hospital Census Forecasts from Hubverse Admission Forecasts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cyril", "Geismar", email = "cyrilgeismar@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Convolves hubverse-format admission quantile forecasts with
    a length-of-stay distribution to produce hubverse-format census
    quantile forecasts. Optional WIS scoring via 'scoringutils'.
